<title>GERMANY: German 1997 sugar beet area put at 510,968 ha-ZMP.</title>
<headline>German 1997 sugar beet area put at 510,968 ha-ZMP.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's farm price office ZMP in latest plantings statistics put sugar beet plantings in 1997 at 510,968 hectares, compared with 515,476 ha in 1996.</p>
<p>An April plantings survey from sugar industry association WVZ said the 1997 area covered 508,687 ha versus WVZ's 1996 figure of 514,452 ha.</p>
<p>ZMP derived the figures from statistics offices and agricultural chambers across 14 German states, not counting the city states of Hamburg and Bremen.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
